{"a":[50,55],"h":"<p>50.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"179\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 179.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.8 40.6 40.6 48.0 48.0 60.8 76.6 76.6 87.0 93.8 100.6 100.6 107.3 125.3 132.0 141.0 141.0 149.3 156.0 156.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8 60.8 93.8 107.3 132.0 162.8\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> onlar da iki kaynak akar. </p><p>- birine Tesnîm denilir birine Selsebîl 52.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"184\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 184.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 27.0 33.8 45.8 45.8 54.0 71.3 71.3 78.0 86.3 86.3 97.6 104.3 120.0 120.0 120.0 130.6 130.6 141.8 150.8 150.8 161.3 161.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.8 54.0 78.0 104.3 168.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her yemişten çifte çifte -meselâ yaşı da var hurusu da, yâhud ikizli, yâhud biri Dünyada ma'ruf biri de gayrı ma'ruf olmak üzere iki sınıf. 54. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 84.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 36.0 42.7 42.7 54.7 54.7 61.6 61.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 54.7 68.3\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> dayanmış oldukları halde - «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"78\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 78.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 21.0 48.7 48.7 59.3 68.3 68.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 27.7 27.7 59.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » deki «men» den haldir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"62\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 62.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 31.4 31.4 39.0 39.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> fürüş - mefruşat, yaygı, döşeme takımları ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"85\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 85.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 38.3 45.0 45.0 51.7 62.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 51.7 62.3 69.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bitaneleri, astarları<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 110.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 28.4 36.0 36.0 42.7 49.4 60.7 60.7 76.4 76.4 87.0 87.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"28.4 42.7 49.4 93.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> istebraktan - kalın ipek kumaştan. Artık yüzlerinin güzelliğini Allah bilir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 133.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 27.0 33.7 40.6 40.6 47.3 60.0 60.0 67.6 83.3 90.0 96.7 108.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 40.6 47.3 90.0 96.7 108.7 117.0\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hem iki Cennetin derimi - meyvaların toplanışı da<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"58\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 57.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 27.0 33.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 41.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> yakından - her vaz'iyyette zahmetsizce alınıverecek derecede yakın. </p>"}